        <mxCell id="v51" parent="1" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontFamily=Helvetica;align=left;fontSize=12;fontColor=#444444;" value="&lt;b&gt;Fig. 9 as drawn.&lt;/b&gt; &lt;font color=&#39;#D7191C&#39;&gt;The C4&lt;sub&gt;QB&lt;/sub&gt; latch is transparent when a3 changes (C4&lt;sub&gt;QB&lt;/sub&gt; is still high at C4&lt;sub&gt;I&lt;/sub&gt;&#39;s rising edge), so a3 races through and D3 changes with D0 instead of 3 UI later.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;Latches transparent while clock high. TA0–TA3 change together while C4&lt;sub&gt;I&lt;/sub&gt; is low. Gray = latch transparent. Labels are bit indices b&lt;sub&gt;n&lt;/sub&gt;, TA&lt;sub&gt;k&lt;/sub&gt; carries b&lt;sub&gt;4m+k&lt;/sub&gt;." vertex="1">
